// vec2::refract: 6 cases, tolerance 12 ULP - n_dot_i is floored (1 ULP), 1 - n_dot_i^2 carries <=
// 3, k = 1 - eta^2 * that <= 1 + 0.25 * 3 ULP; for eta <= 1/2 the domain keeps k >= 3/4, so
// sqrt(k) adds <= 3 / (2 * sqrt(k)) + 1 <= 3 ULP, and the last mul_sub multiplies it by |normal|
// <= 1: <= 12 ULP. The total-internal-reflection branch (k < 0) never triggers for eta <= 1/2 and
// is covered by tests/test_vec2.cairo.
